OL,3,GNEWSATriple killer custody officer
OL,4,A'shocked' over killings
OL,5,
OL,6,FA custody officer said she was
OL,7,F"shocked" when a man she had dealt with
OL,8,Fkilled three elderly men two days
OL,9,Flater.
OL,11,FAlexander Lewis-Ranwell, now 35, had
OL,12,Fbeen arrested twice and released from
OL,13,Fcustody before he killed Anthony Payne,
OL,14,F80, and twins Roger and Dick Carter, 84
OL,15,Fin Exeter on 10 February 2019.
OL,17,FLewis-Ranwell had a history of mental
OL,18,Fhealth problems, including
OL,19,Fcannabis-induced psychosis, and had
OL,20,Falso been detained under the Mental
OL,21,FHealth Act in 2016 and again in 2017,
OL,22,Finquests in Exeter have heard.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
