OL,3,GNEWSATriple killer custody officer
OL,4,A'shocked' over killings
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Sgt Heather Smith told the hearing
OL,7,Fshe did not believe signs of his mental
OL,8,Fstate were missed during the first
OL,9,Farrest on 8 February and said: "You
OL,10,Fcannot foresee what a person is going
OL,11,Fto do."
